    "limitations": "The model uses a published 12 m figure and 10 m pedestal. The taper, sculpted folds, lettering, plinth and stair dimensions are fitted to photographs. The named monument point and the signed back edge of the mapped pedestrian terrace fix position and orientation. Standard terrain resolves the surrounding hillside. Exact stair treads and landscaping within the plaza are photograph-based estimates. The modeled site covers the pedestal and the nearest stairs and planters. Surrounding cemetery paths, graves and terrain come from the map context. Physical-device timings remain unmeasured."
